# NV-13 — Du lieu va toi uu backend

UC: 135-141  
Actors: system, operations officer  
Status: specified; browser mock only; backend adapter pending.

## Scope

Search indexing, scheduled cleaning, privacy encryption, auto-tagging, content/search metrics, antivirus scanning and slow-query monitoring.

## Acceptance criteria

- Index updates are idempotent and show last successful run.
- Personal fields are masked/encrypted at rest in the mock adapter contract.
- Attachments cannot become available before virus-scan success.
- Slow queries carry correlation id and safe diagnostic metadata.

